t (or catastrophically wrong)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_68__1_.png?t=1750947409\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack the Loot &amp; Get Paid!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load everything into lootboxes, seal them, and send them off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better loot means <strong>more gold and stars</strong>, unlocking <strong>new recipes, characters, and challenges</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/workbenches.png?t=1750947409\" /></div></p>","developers":["Berries Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/e196566474a91ceadd158d1b8327c200355aa42f/header.jpg?t=1750947409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150597,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150597/movie480.mp4?t=1749060660","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150597/movie_max.mp4?t=1749060660"},"name":"DEMO is LIVE NOW","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150597/1de6ddaf657201a5ca56df46b7f1096b7458f09d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749060660","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150597/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749060660","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150597/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749060660"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257100321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie480.mp4?t=1743488174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie_max.mp4?t=1743488174"},"name":"The Artifactory \u2013 Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100321/cb7aea729c01f01a07c08c73ed6bcd62ea168e7f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743488174","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743488174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743488174"}}],"name":"The Artifactory","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIN10-64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 / AMD A8-5600k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li