11520/ss_109d68fae59aceef6e391896aea943ab5b435e76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750947409","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/ss_109d68fae59aceef6e391896aea943ab5b435e76.600x338.jpg?t=1750947409"}],"short_description":"The Artifactory is a chaotic and humorous couch co-op party game! Experiment with resources, discover new recipes, and fill lootboxes with wild creations. Play solo or with up to 4 players as you navigate hazards and fix machines in a magical fantasy factory!","steam_appid":3511520,"support_info":{"email":"games@berriesand.co","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Hungarian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://theartifactorygame.com/"}